WEBVTT

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:10.000
Someone sealed the tablet to my memories and stole the God Cards.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.730
And a new enemy appeared before us: Doma's Three Musketeers!

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:21.860
Their servant dueled me using a dark power different than a Millennium Item's.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:27.510
Orichalcos's power is strong enough to control Obelisk?

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:48.070
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:55.210
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:56.010 --> 00:01:01.890
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:07.850
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:15.220
With our memories fading

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:22.300
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:29.200
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:36.430
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:56.590 --> 00:02:02.330
The Seal of Orichalcos

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.600
This seal even works on a God.

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:38.540
Even Valkyrion can't defeat a God!

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:40.740
Dark Obelisk attacks!

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.400
Vanish, Valkyrion the Magna Warrior!

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.910
God Hand Crusher!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:55.530
Yugi!

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:59.690
Is there a way to destroy a powered-up Obelisk?

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:02.980
Your key card is gone.

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:05.160
I end my turn.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:10.580
He can really use a God Card without any risk?

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:30.400
Even with The Seal of Orichalcos, you can't completely subjugate a God.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:33.330
This task is too hard for your servant.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:37.800
He's the perfect opponent to test the Nameless Pharaoh's power.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:42.020
I have no way of defeating a God right now.

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:43.730
My turn!

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:47.260
I activate the spell card, Graceful Charity!

00:03:53.630 --> 00:04:00.720
Due to its effect, I draw three cards and discard two to the graveyard!

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.650
I'll keep these.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:07.110
I summon a monster in defense position.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:11.830
Then I set a card and end my turn!

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.510
My turn.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.760
I set a card.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.740
Dark Obelisk attacks!

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:24.380
God Hand Crusher!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:33.420
Damn!  Yugi has no monsters again!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:35.950
Soon...

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:43.880
Yugi, your soul will soon be sacrificed to our god.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.330
Sacrificed?

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:50.000
Yes.  The loser's soul will be sacrificed to our god...

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.940
...who'll lead this dirty world to destruction.

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:56.560
And feed the creation of a new world!

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.640
What's he talking about?

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:01.730
I've heard the same thing before...

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.320
The omen has begun.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.520
The world will soon end.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:13.400
Did you do something to Haga and Ryuzaki?

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:14.460
Yes.

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:18.900
It's them!

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:21.390
So that's where you are!

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:22.330
Just wait!

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:28.510
Are you okay, Jonouchi?

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:31.320
Honda!  Are you trying to kill me?

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:35.130
Their souls are in my hand.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:39.250
They will be sacrificed to resurrect our god.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:41.100
Haga!  Ryuzaki!

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:43.190
Their souls are trapped in cards?

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:50.660
They have powers equal to Pegasus's dark power?

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:56.740
I thought I was going to die.

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:59.840
Yugi, it's your turn.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:05.340
If you don't play a monster card this turn, your soul will vanish.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.280
My turn!

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:13.720
You should worry about yourself instead of me.

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:15.170
What?

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:19.170
I activate the spell card, Monster Reborn!

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:24.280
I resurrect Valkyrion the Magna Warrior!

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:26.440
That's pointless!

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:31.620
Valkyrion isn't strong enough to destroy Dark Obelisk!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.500
It's true that Dark Obelisk is very powerful.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:38.550
But what if something is stronger?

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:41.080
Stronger than Dark Obelisk?

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:44.400
Yes.  The bond of courage!

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.340
I'll prove it!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:49.710
Valkyrion disassembles!

00:06:57.130 --> 00:07:00.660
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:02.200
Brave Attack!

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:05.670
Go, Magnet Warriors!

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:11.640
What?

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:18.680
Such a bad strategy.

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:19.890
You lost your mind.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:21.480
Are you sure?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:24.550
Look at Dark Obelisk's body!

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:32.660
Impossible!  Your Magnet Warriors have far fewer attack points than Obelisk!

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:35.130
But I activated Brave Attack.

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:43.400
In exchange for their lives, they combine their attack points to battle your monster.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.010
What?

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:47.820
Alpha has 1400 attack points.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.880
Beta has 1700 attack points.

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:54.950
So Dark Obelisk has already taken 3100 points of damage.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:58.840
Dark Obelisk has 4500 attack points.

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:05.160
What happens if I add Gamma The Magnet Warrior's 1500 attack points?

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:09.000
Go, Gamma The Magnet Warrior!

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.280
All right!

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:29.460
Wow!  He destroyed Dark Obelisk!

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.130
He's incredible.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:32.380
Impressive.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:35.760
He already knows how to defeat a God Card.

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.090
Of course.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.100
My turn.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.880
Obelisk is gone.

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:47.150
But The Seal of Orichalcos's power is only getting started!

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:50.480
The spell card, Card of Sanctity!

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:57.690
They now both have six cards, and their life points are equal.

00:08:57.690 --> 00:09:01.550
But monsters on his field power up quickly.

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.720
Yugi is still in a horrible position.

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:18.330
How lucky!  When I get this monster in my hand during a non-regular draw, I can summon it.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:22.040
That weakling can't do anything!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.880
I summon Warrior Dai Grepher!

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:36.480
I flip over my set card, Dark Renewal!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:44.360
This card tributes your monster and my monster...

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:48.960
...to resurrect a Spellcaster from my Graveyard!

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:58.840
I resurrect Dark Magician!

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:08.350
You used Graceful Charity to send Dark Magician to the graveyard.

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:12.130
You no longer have any monsters.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:17.110
My Dark Magician will finish you next turn!

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:21.900
I set a card and end my turn.

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.080
Good!

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.070
Yugi is going to win!

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.500
My turn!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.480
Go, Dark Magician!

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.500
Attack him directly!

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:34.820
The Quick-Play Spell, Shield Wall!

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:37.050
What?

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:39.640
That wasn't good enough.

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:44.490
Shield Wall summons four monsters with 1000 defense points.

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:47.660
Your attack won't hit me!

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:56.840
Yugi, you'll now see the true power of The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:11:00.820
I activate the spell card, Bronze Knights!

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:06.690
For every card I discard, I summon a Bronze Knight Token.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:12.410
No way!  Six monsters?

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:16.640
Hey!  Wait a minute!

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.660
You can't do that!

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:23.200
You can't summon more than five monsters in Duel Monsters!

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:28.460
But I can when I'm inside The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:35.340
The seal expands the Monster Zone into the Magic & Trap Zone.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:41.800
That means he can summon up to ten monsters at a time?

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:48.500
Yes.  And you must destroy the monsters in the front to attack the monsters in the back.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:49.400
What?

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:54.700
The Orichalcos powers up my Bronze Knights!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:05.970
Even Dark Magician will have trouble against six monsters.

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:11.440
The monsters in attack position are in the back, so I can't deal damage.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:14.210
The monsters in front are protecting them.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:20.210
The Seal of Orichalcos is unlike any card I've faced before.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:22.850
This will be a tough duel.

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:50.960
I set two cards and summon Queen's Knight in defense position.

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:52.540
I end my turn.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:54.010
My turn.

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:56.160
I activate my trap card!

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:56.720
What?

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.860
Dust Tornado!

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:04.640
This card destroys your spell or trap card!

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:08.330
I destroy The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:14.670
Good!  If that Seal is gone...

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.910
What?  The Seal didn't vanish!

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:25.600
That was pointless.

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:31.850
Only the power of Orichalcos can destroy The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:33.440
Too bad.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:36.960
I activate the spell card, The Warrior Returning Alive.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:41.380
I retrieve Dai Grepher from my graveyard and summon it.

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:46.910
Gain Orichalcos's power, Dai Grepher!

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:55.570
I activate the Continuous Spell, The A. Forces!

00:13:55.570 --> 00:14:03.220
For every Warrior and Spellcaster on my field, they gain 200 attack points.

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:10.160
I have four Warriors on my field, so my monsters gain 800 attack points!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.730
Vanish, Dark Magician!

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:14.620
Dai Grepher attacks!

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:20.970
My attack isn't over yet!

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:24.140
All your monsters are now destroyed!

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:25.840
Sacrifice Escape!

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:27.920
What?

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:31.050
The Quick-Play Spell, Magical Academy!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.020
Dark Magician Girl!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.820
By discarding two cards from my hand...

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:46.460
...I can summon a monster and raise its Level by 2 and its attack points by 500.

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:51.130
You dodged my attack by tributing your monster!

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:57.240
And she gains 300 attack points for every Dark Magician in my graveyard!

00:14:57.460 --> 00:14:58.870
My turn!

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:02.270
There are seven monsters on his field.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:06.700
Only that card can turn this situation around...

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.750
If I don't draw it...

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.690
I believe in my deck!

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:15.000
I draw!

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:19.290
Yes!

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:25.100
I activate the spell card, Diffusion Wave-Motion!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.220
What?

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:29.570
He drew Diffusion Wave-Motion at this moment?

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:35.890
Go, Dark Magician Girl!

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:41.010
Black Burning Burst!

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:50.920
By paying 1000 life points, Diffusion Wave-Motion lets her attack all your monsters!

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.160
No way!

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:55.730
Yugi!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.800
That was close.

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:04.620
Rafael...

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:07.340
Take the God Card!

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:22.870
Gurimo...

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:29.250
Gurimo would've won if he had one more turn.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.840
But that's what makes it fun.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.450
Let's leave.

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:35.500
Wait!

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.900
Give my God Cards back!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:41.340
Only if you defeat us three.

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:44.780
We'll come for your soul soon.

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:48.240
But I'll give you back these weaklings.

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:57.920
What's this?

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:03.160
We'll meet again, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.560
Hey!  Wait!

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:07.020
Running away?  Cowards!

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:09.340
Come down and duel me!

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:13.420
Be patient, Katsuya Jonouchi.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:17.110
We'll duel soon enough.

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.200
My name is Valon.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.560
Remember it.

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:22.480
Wait!

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:23.680
Damn!

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:29.390
Is he dead?

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:30.220
No.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.230
But his soul is gone.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:35.830
This is...

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:39.770
His soul is sealed inside this card.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.940
Yugi, look at this.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.110
It's pretty.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:53.200
It feels similar to the Millennium Item's dark powers.

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:02.220
What are you doing?

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:04.280
Yeah!  You're creeping me out!

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:06.130
We can say the same thing!

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:08.640
You ran when you saw us!

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:12.210
Let them go, Jonouchi and Honda.

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:16.200
Tell us what happened to you.

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:18.980
I hate thinking about it!

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:20.140
Yeah!

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:24.680
You're Dinosaur Ryuzaki and Insector Haga.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.620
What?

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.580
What do you want with us?

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:29.940
Don't waste your breath!

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:31.160
Duel!

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:37.400
We dueled him, and he totally beat us-

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:38.360
Ouch!

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:40.190
It was a close match!

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:44.880
But he cheated, using a card named The Seal of something...

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:46.730
The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.660
Yeah!  That one!

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:51.580
What?  Is he a friend of yours?

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.500
Of course not!

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:57.480
Yugi rescued your souls from him!

00:18:58.460 --> 00:19:03.380
What did you mean when you said that the world will end?

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:05.920
We said that?

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:07.800
I don't remember.

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:08.840
I see.

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:11.530
Anyway, Yugi...

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:15.600
Can you show me your God Cards?

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:16.830
Yeah!

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:20.270
Well...  They stole them.

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:21.380
What?

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:22.600
Really?

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:23.610
Yeah.

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:26.960
We'll find them and get the cards back!

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:30.900
Let us know if you remember anything.

00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:32.410
R-Right!

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:34.580
We promise!

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:37.970
Just kidding.

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:39.110
How naïve.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:42.200
If I find them first...

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.550
The God Cards are mine!

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:52.420
The newspapers and TV have recently been reporting this story.

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:56.480
About children acting as if they've lost their souls.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:20:00.500
Yeah.  It's happening around the world.

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:03.760
So they're hunting duelists worldwide?

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:06.940
Duelists who hunts souls...

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:08.800
Hi, darling!

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.620
I missed you, darling!

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:14.490
W-Who are you?

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:16.340
C'mon, darling!

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:20.760
Did you forget your promise about our sweet future?

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:21.440
Huh?

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:24.410
What promise about your future?

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:29.030
Look.  You gave me this card as proof.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.910
Card?

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:33.040
Oh!  This card!

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:35.050
Rebecca, take this.

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:38.040
The Ties of Friendship?

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:39.980
Yeah.  I want you to have it.

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:40.980
Yugi!

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:43.320
You're...

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:45.260
Rebecca?

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:46.320
Hi!

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:49.750
Huh?  You look totally different.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:52.150
Where's your teddy bear?

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:58.260
I don't need it anymore because I have a real boyfriend now!

00:20:58.260 --> 00:21:00.700
And who's this boyfriend?

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:04.480
Americans grow up fast.

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:06.960
That's not the issue.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:09.140
You came to Japan to see Yugi?

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:13.480
Oh yeah!  My grandpa wants to talk to you.

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:15.150
Professor Hopkins?

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:21.420
Professor Hopkins!

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.390
Yugi.

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:28.370
We need to talk, Yugi-

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:31.080
No, I mean Nameless Pharaoh.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:08.950
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:17.290
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:28.450
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:37.970
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:47.000
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:47.780 --> 00:22:52.510
I'll live feeling them

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:57.690
For me to be me

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:06.150
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:11.790
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:12.310 --> 00:23:21.450
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:30.170
Rebecca suddenly came to visit Yugi.

00:23:30.170 --> 00:23:34.220
Sheesh!  You surprised me because you called him "darling!"

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:39.480
At the museum, Professor Hopkins told us the surprising truth.

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:43.500
The ruins he found underwater and this incident are related?

00:23:43.500 --> 00:23:47.040
And it's connected to the other Yugi's lost memories?

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:50.640
I'm getting so confused!

00:23:50.640 --> 00:23:53.440
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Nameless Dragon Timaeus

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:55.120
Duel, standby!
